insert into minute_item(meeting_id,section,ordinal,heading,body) values ((select id from meeting where meeting_date='2025-10-13' limit 1),'report',1,'Lily Strange - Internal Chair','Thank you all for your help at the chairs meeting! Some updates! A lot more chairs filled out our open positions spreadsheet, I updated the website and sent out a umail announcement. Most orgs had their own external applications and are conducting their own hiring, with these exceptions (if anyone accidentally applies through the CoC app for an external application, I will email them) GCC → need more info from them IVTU → need more info EVPSA → listed that they would like CoC to collaborate with interviewing, but also have an external application We need more information on this Senate Outreach Committee → application hosted on CoC site, but are conducting their own hiring, we need to forward any applicants to as-nluken@ucsb.edu and as-nharter@ucsb.edu Controls and Compliance→ application hosted on CoC site, but are conducting their own hiring, we need to forward any applicants to cco@as.ucsb.edu → Shuyi can you please do this for Senate Outreach and Controls and Compliance so we don’t accidentally forward these applications multiple times We need to publicize this application to poli sci list serv, comms list serv, and history list serv Maybe we can combine this with advertising Senate Outreach and EVPSA Office of the Student Advocate We are hosting the application and conducting interviews Need to reach out for more info on the extent they want to be involved And then of course CoC’s hiring! No deliberations this week, we will wait for more applicants and regroup next meeting Welcome Oliver! As internal liaison you have three main responsibilities: Chairs Meeting → we will revisit later, this will be monday, week 2, 6-7pm at the UCEN both winter and spring quarters Honoraria Committee → has Enri reached out to you yet? Keeping connected with BCU chairs → a main goal i');
