insert into minute_item(meeting_id,section,ordinal,heading,body) values ((select id from meeting where meeting_date='2025-10-20' limit 1),'report',1,'Lily Strange - Internal Chair','QOTW: Roderick Hefley Updates on hirings GCC → reached out, waiting to hear back IVTU → all positions are closed, I updated the spreadsheet EVPSA → ?? still no info? Mira, would you be able to ask them directly at the meeting you attend? Senate Outreach Committee → closed their application Controls and Compliance→ Shuyi how is this going Office of the Student Advocate We are hosting the application and conducting interviews Have not yet heard back about the extent they want to be involved We only have 2 applicants so far, Mira how is the pub going for this? And then of course CoC’s hiring! Still only one applicant, and they never scheduled an interview… we may have to deliberate on the applicants we have CoC project updates (can discuss in your reports) Updating the AS Chairs email list (Shuyi) Advertising EVPSA, Senate Outreach, Controls and Compliance, and Office of the Student Advocate (mira) Advertising the CoC website in general as the place to find out about AS openings Today is the deadline for the President’s newsletter https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe89rYIeE2M6P4MGjaoYAmqFpasjRtrLUA0kSyxMVoEArTWnA/viewform I’ll do this and just submit our website info and maybe any info on open positions Following up individually with GCC, IVTU, EVPSA and OSA (Lily) (Updated above) Website troubleshooting (Yeshua) AS web developer → Alex Herbaugh Website SOP → have not done this yet … does anyone need it urgently Following up on spreadsheet, updates, questions, etc Some BCU’s may have closed out applications, we need to know if those are still open Every one except the green rows (all filled) and OSA');
