insert into minute_item(meeting_id,section,ordinal,heading,body) values ((select id from meeting where meeting_date='2026-01-12' limit 1),'report',1,'Lily Strange - Internal Chair','QOTW: networking! I think practicing networking in AS is a lot more chill, since everyone is a student vs jumping right into networking with real adults. Chairs meeting notes: New GC! We are giving this one more go and then resorting to slack or groupme. Sophia can you add everyone to a chat and we can test it? Hiring updates: Website …??? The AS positions tab disappeared and we got two applications for things that are not open I emailed the two applicants and offered them an interview for the pro temp and OSA positions if they want them OSA form Outreach is not hiring, IG post + mailing list announcements To publicize: OSA → google form TBTN and PMHC openings, details in our open positions spreadsheet Second president pro temp… Event planning for the year O&R, let’s do 2 events this quarter: Ideas from our budget proposal, we can change or add more: Committees Cafe → coffee hour with tabling orgs that are hiring Mira & rylee Valentines themed matchmaking event, but students complete a career quiz to find their committee fit Dinner with the chairs, learn about AS orgs that are hiring with free dinner Vision boards, how AS can fit into your career goals Layla, Savanah AS job fair / recruitment fair (spring quarter, but we can start planning now if this would be a bigger event) In general, we want to plan on having a big event spring quarter to use budget Maybe work in teams of 2? Honoraria reviews Chairs meeting closing email / wrap up Oliver, you can send this out sometime this week, no rush Merch and logos! We can work with CMU to design cute stickers, tote bags, a new logo, etc. Is anyone interested in taking this project on? You will have to communicate with graphic designers in CMU, we can discuss ideas as a committee of designs, etc COSWB worked with them for desig');
