insert into minute_item(meeting_id,section,ordinal,heading,body) values ((select id from meeting where meeting_date='2026-01-05' limit 1),'report',1,'Lily Strange - Internal Chair','Honoraria update We got our budget request approved! Let’s brainstorm potential outreach initiatives for the year! Here are the ones we had on our request If anyone wants to take point on one of these, please let me know! For the tablecloth, thoughts on getting a plain white canvas cloth and painting it? Could be cheaper. We do now have the budget for a printed one, would be ~$100 Now that we have $$, I can order some tabling items for us Does anyone want to design cute stickers? Examples from my COSWB co-chair Hiring Need to update the spreadsheet, maybe we can do a check in to any orgs still on there, if they are still hiring, if so, what support they need from us → Oliver this can wait until after the chairs meeting One pro temp position left → senior advisor OSA has an open position we are hiring for Let’s make a post, something like make your new years resolution to join AS / new year new AS positions, etc Chairs meeting → Oliver Next Monday! We should email about this tonight to the AS Chairs email list I made a doc with a loose outline, most important is sending an announcement / reminder ASAP Let’s pass money for catering, any ideas for food? What main reminders should we emphasize? Those forms for requisitions and honoraria Sean sent AS newsletter (internal and external) Open position spreadsheet, as always Updating meeting times in the winter quarter meeting times spreadsheet Honoraria update (pending senate this week) Liaison committee info from that email Bonding activity → find someone from another group, think of a new years resolution your entities have in common to serve the student body / advance your mission Relevant info from F25 slideshow (how appointments work, anonymous feedback form for AS in general) Schedule for help at setup! Put your name unde');
